# The option menus from the main menu: the volumes, the saved games, the
# advanced options, back to the main menu. A menu that returns on Return
# leaves the next to read the same key while it is down, so keys are
# short here. A menu keeps its selection. The port shows the main menu
# about 36 s after it starts.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot options
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot volume
key Return
sleep 3
shot back
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot saves
key Return
sleep 3
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot advanced
key Return
sleep 3
key Up Up Up Return
sleep 3
shot main
